{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\Books\\6th\\Math\\JPG\\161.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "Total area of top and bottom faces = 2 × (l × w)", "conf": 0.928, "box": [[210, 199], [937, 171], [939, 218], [212, 246]]}, {"text": "Total area of front and back faces = 2 × (l × h)", "conf": 0.902, "box": [[219, 462], [916, 443], [917, 479], [220, 498]]}, {"text": "h'", "conf": 0.567, "box": [[1341, 707], [1371, 713], [1365, 744], [1335, 739]]}, {"text": "Total area of left and right faces = 2 × (w × h)", "conf": 0.92, "box": [[220, 725], [921, 712], [921, 755], [221, 767]]}, {"text": "If we add all the above areas, we get the total surface area of the cuboid.", "conf": 0.926, "box": [[221, 880], [1373, 863], [1373, 905], [222, 923]]}, {"text": "Total surface area of cuboid = 2 × (l × w) +2 × (l × h) + 2 × (w × h)", "conf": 0.882, "box": [[225, 935], [1247, 922], [1247, 960], [226, 973]]}, {"text": "Takeout2ascommon.", "conf": 0.913, "box": [[230, 991], [593, 991], [593, 1021], [230, 1021]]}, {"text": "Total surface area of the cuboid = 2 × [(l × w) + (l × h) + (w × h)]", "conf": 0.919, "box": [[226, 1038], [1235, 1033], [1235, 1073], [227, 1078]]}, {"text": "Example 1:", "conf": 0.905, "box": [[234, 1134], [422, 1134], [422, 1178], [234, 1178]]}, {"text": "Findthesurfacearea of thegivencube.", "conf": 0.877, "box": [[237, 1217], [851, 1217], [851, 1252], [237, 1252]]}, {"text": "Solution:", "conf": 0.805, "box": [[238, 1297], [392, 1297], [392, 1335], [238, 1335]]}, {"text": "4m", "conf": 0.662, "box": [[1015, 1349], [1073, 1354], [1071, 1383], [1013, 1378]]}, {"text": "Length of the cube", "conf": 0.913, "box": [[238, 1381], [541, 1378], [541, 1417], [239, 1420]]}, {"text": "= 4m", "conf": 0.762, "box": [[633, 1379], [745, 1379], [745, 1417], [633, 1417]]}, {"text": "Surface area of the cube = 6 (length)", "conf": 0.921, "box": [[239, 1459], [841, 1461], [841, 1503], [239, 1500]]}, {"text": "= 6 × (4 m)2", "conf": 0.83, "box": [[636, 1539], [836, 1541], [836, 1588], [635, 1586]]}, {"text": "= 6×(4m×4 m)", "conf": 0.8, "box": [[642, 1625], [922, 1632], [921, 1669], [641, 1662]]}, {"text": "= 6 × 16 m²", "conf": 0.824, "box": [[644, 1707], [838, 1707], [838, 1748], [644, 1748]]}, {"text": "= 96 m²", "conf": 0.776, "box": [[643, 1785], [787, 1785], [787, 1833], [643, 1833]]}, {"text": "ask them how did they find the volume.", "conf": 0.892, "box": [[334, 1915], [858, 1926], [858, 1959], [334, 1948]]}, {"text": "Ask students one day before to bring empty boxes of cube or cuboid shape in class", "conf": 0.953, "box": [[332, 1954], [1450, 1973], [1449, 2025], [331, 2005]]}, {"text": "then next day students will find the volume?surface area of those boxes.", "conf": 0.943, "box": [[336, 1997], [1289, 2024], [1288, 2063], [334, 2036]]}, {"text": "NOTFORSALE", "conf": 0.898, "box": [[341, 2098], [617, 2098], [617, 2131], [341, 2131]]}, {"text": "159", "conf": 0.749, "box": [[915, 2114], [983, 2114], [983, 2152], [915, 2152]]}]}